  "description": "A .NET library for communicating with rf IDEAS readers (WaveID, pcProx, and more) using a high-level reader interface. Supports Windows x64, Linux x64, Linux ARM64, Linux ARMhf, and macOS (Intel + Apple Silicon, Monterey 12+) with bundled native libraries. Provides reader initialization, metadata retrieval, beeper control, and card data operations.",
